    "notes": "Mu'izz al-Din Muhammad was installed at Ghazna in 1173-1174 with the title of sultan and ruled in a dynastic dyarchy with his elder brother Ghiyath al-Din Muhammad. ATLAS therefore separates this co-sultan phase from his later sole supremacy after his brother's death in 1203."
